            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Choose any magic square that you have made so far using consecutive numbers. If m is the letter-number of the number in the centre, express how other numbers are related to m, how much more or less than m. [Hint: Remember, how we described a 2 × 2 grid of a calendar month in the Algebraic Expressions chapter].",
